    "Save normal and fallback texture coordinates with a retained strip pose after first use. Revalidate artwork, source texture coordinates and masks on pose restore.",
    "Retain UV arrays for strip junction triangles and quads. Resolve color and alpha on the native draw path without caching their values.",
    "Skip basis and draw-layer setup for fallback plans with no rectangles."
  ],
